  "description": "Se-Han wasn’t expecting to be turned on...but after catching a glimpse of Chan-Hyeong in bed with another man, he can’t shake the curiosity. As Se-Han begins to grow closer to Chan-Hyeong, Jin-Wu, who’s always had feelings for Se-Han, starts to suspect something. Fueled by jealousy and a few too many drinks, Jin-Wu confronts Se-Han one night. Se-Han’s response? He makes an unexpected proposition…one that blurs every line between friendship and desire.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
